## Validation checklist

After both phases land, verify end-to-end:

- [ ] New user signs up → opens `/agent-verification` → fills all fields + uploads two images → submit succeeds.
- [ ] Same user re-opens `/agent-verification` → sees read-only summary, not the empty form.
- [ ] Admin opens `/admin/manage-agents` → sees the new applicant in Pending with Business + CNIC columns populated.
- [ ] Admin clicks **View** → lands on detail page → sees all fields + clickable CNIC images.
- [ ] Admin clicks **Approve** in the detail page → status flips → applicant disappears from Pending → moves to Active.
- [ ] Approved agent logs in → `/agent` is reachable; their `business_name` shows up where `name` used to.
- [ ] Second user tries to register with the same `cnic_number` → API responds 409.
- [ ] Hot-link test: copying a CNIC image URL into an incognito browser returns 403 / expires within 1h.
- [ ] Lint check on `frontend/src/lib/api.ts`, `frontend/src/pages/AgentVerification.tsx`, `frontend/src/pages/AgentProfileDetail.tsx`, `frontend/src/pages/ManageAgents.tsx`, `backend/app/api/admin.py`, `backend/app/api/auth.py`.

